msgstr ""
"Used for genealogical records (tree, future export to other genealogy "
"software); leave blank if this place is unknown."

#: annuaire/forms.py:41
msgid ""
"Un export GEDCOM (pour Geneanet, MyHeritage, Gramps...) est destiné à "
"quitter le site, potentiellement vers un service public. Par défaut, vos "
"informations y sont masquées tant que vous êtes en vie. « Toujours masquer » "
"s'applique aussi au carnet d'adresses Excel et au flux calendrier."
msgstr ""
"A GEDCOM export (for Geneanet, MyHeritage, Gramps...) is meant to leave the "
"site, potentially towards a public service. By default, your information is "
"hidden there while you are alive. \"Always hide\" also applies to the Excel "
"address book and the calendar feed."

